# Ignore _tftool/ contents but allow a few dev tools through. Pattern uses
# `_tftool/*` (not `_tftool/`) so git still descends into the directory and
# evaluates the `!` re-include patterns below. With `_tftool/` git would
# never recurse and the exceptions would be silently dropped.
_tftool/*
!_tftool/lumos_mock_server.py
!_tftool/run_with_lumos_mock.py
error screens/
qa_full_run_postfix.log
qa_*.log
.phase24_diffs/
